# Topic 2 · Feminist Theories and Practice

> Syllabus head III. 128 one-liners, 26 past MCQs and 32 practice MCQs.

The second most tested topic. The past MCQs keep coming back to the same books (*The Second Sex*, *The Feminine Mystique*, *The Dialectic of Sex*). Since 2023 they have moved to concepts: post-structural feminism, standpoint, kyriarchy, the patriarchal bargain and the matrix of domination. The practice set fills the gaps: early liberal texts, Marxist and socialist feminism, psychoanalytic and French feminism, postmodernism, Black, eco- and Muslim feminism.

