# Topic 4 · Gender and Development

> Syllabus head V. 126 one-liners, 19 past MCQs and 32 practice MCQs.

The past MCQs test WID, WAD and GAD, mainstreaming and the MDGs and SDGs. The practice set covers development thinkers (Haq, Sen, Rostow, Frank, Wallerstein's critics), colonialism, Boserup, the planning frameworks (Moser, Kabeer, Longwe), structural adjustment, globalisation and climate.

