# Topic 5 · Status of Women in Pakistan

> Syllabus head VI. 120 one-liners, 19 past MCQs and 33 practice MCQs.

Pakistan's laws and indicators. The past MCQs repeat the same few dates: the MFLO (1961), the workplace harassment law (2010) and the marriage age (16). The practice set covers the gender-gap ranks, health, education and employment figures, the Constitution's articles, family-law details and the newer laws.

