# Topic 6 · Gender and Governance

> Syllabus head VII. 120 one-liners, 14 past MCQs and 35 practice MCQs.

The past MCQs test women's firsts and seat numbers: two women in the first Constituent Assembly, 60 reserved seats, 33% in local government, Fahmida Mirza and Benazir Bhutto. The practice set adds governance and representation theory (Pitkin, Phillips, Kanter, Dahlerup), the suffrage history, voters and candidates in 2024, and the history of quotas.

