# Topic 7 · Gender-Based Violence and the Three Case Studies

> Syllabus heads VIII and IX. 125 one-liners, 12 past MCQs and 38 practice MCQs.

The past MCQs test the definition of GBV, social learning theory, the 1-in-3 figure, the 2016 honour law and the three case studies. The practice set covers the UN framework, the theories of violence (Walker, Duluth, Heise, Galtung), masculinities, Pakistan's data and laws, the Punjab Act 2016 and the case-study details.

